## 7. FRONTEND STRUCTURE

### 7.1 Folder Structure

```
cameraman-pro/
├── index.html                    ← Root HTML file (Vite entry point)
├── vite.config.ts                ← Vite build configuration
├── tailwind.config.js            ← TailwindCSS theme config
├── tsconfig.json                 ← TypeScript compiler config
├── capacitor.config.ts           ← Mobile (Android) config
├── firestore.rules               ← Database security rules
├── firestore.indexes.json        ← Query indexes for Firestore
├── .env                          ← API keys (never commit to Git!)
├── package.json                  ← Dependencies & scripts
│
└── src/
    ├── main.tsx                  ← App entry point, React DOM render
    ├── App.tsx                   ← Root: routing tree + context providers
    ├── index.css                 ← Global Tailwind imports
