## 12. SEO & MARKETING

### 12.1 SEO Implementation

The public pages use:
- Standard HTML `<title>` and `<meta description>` tags in [index.html](file:///c:/Users/Play%20Edit%20Solution/Desktop/Cameraman%20Pro/index.html)
- Semantic HTML5 structure (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`)
- Single `<h1>` per page with proper heading hierarchy

### 12.2 Current SEO Limitations

> [!NOTE]
> Since this is a **React SPA (Single Page Application)**, search engines may have difficulty indexing the content. Google's crawler does execute JavaScript, but slower bots may not.

**Recommended improvements:**
- Add **React Helmet** for per-page dynamic meta tags
- Migrate to **Next.js** for server-side rendering (SSR) — makes pages fully indexable
- Add a `sitemap.xml` and `robots.txt`

### 12.3 Firebase Analytics

- `getAnalytics(app)` is initialized in [firebase.ts](file:///c:/Users/Play%20Edit%20Solution/Desktop/Cameraman%20Pro/src/lib/firebase.ts)
- Tracks: page views, user sessions, custom events
- View in Firebase Console → Analytics

### 12.4 Marketing Strategy

- WhatsApp integration (owner number: 8601343232 mentioned in BĀBU prompt)
- Public offer/discount pages (`/offers`) drive conversions
- Portfolio gallery showcases work quality to potential customers
- Order tracking builds trust with clients

